### Get all equipment (should show empty or your items)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/equipment

### Add a new equipment (change the details to your real machine)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/equipment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Main Pump 1",
  "type": "Pump",
  "status": "Operational",
  "lastMaintenance": "2025-11-15",
  "nextMaintenance": "2026-05-15"
}